===Etymology 2===
From {{etyl|enm|en}} {{term|telt|lang=enm}}, from {{etyl|ang|en}} {{term|teld||tent|lang=ang}}, from {{etyl|gml|en}} {{term|telt|lang=gml}},<ref>[http://ordnet.dk/ods/opslag?opslag=telt&submit=S%F8g Etymology] in [[:w:da:ODS|ODS]]</ref> perhaps via or influenced by {{etyl|da|en}} {{term|telt|lang=da}}.<ref>{{R:Webster 1913|tilt}}</ref> Cognates include German {{term|Zelt||tent|lang=de}}, Old Norse {{term|tjald||tent|lang=non}} (whence also archaic Danish {{term|tjæld||tent|lang=da}}). More at {{l|en|teld}}.

